From 94d7d913036b141033fbd94aa586bbebb5d7c45b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Christopher Owen <christopherowen@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 23:33:51 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(sched): size-classed prefill lanes and aligned-chunk
 lane rotation

Upstream base: 1107 vLLM patch head after 0762.

Rationale:
1. When align_prefill_chunks=True and max_parallel_prefills > 1, capping each lane to prefill_interleave_step.token_budget (token_budget // active_lanes) splits the step budget below aligned_chunk (long_prefill_token_threshold), causing num_new_tokens < aligned_chunk to skip every selected long prefill each step without releasing its lane. Exempt aligned chunks from per-step lane-share splitting so parallel lanes rotate whole aligned chunks across steps instead.
2. Add size-classed prefill lanes (--prefill-long-threshold and --max-long-prefills, defaulting to 1 when prefill_long_threshold > 0) to bound concurrent long prefills while reserving the remaining parallel lanes for short requests (ordered by remaining uncached tokens after prefix-cache lookup, with 8-step starvation aging) and skipping waiting long prefills at the long-lane cap so short work queued behind them is not head-of-line blocked.
3. Prevent multi-lane prefill livelocks by excluding blocked waiting statuses (WAITING_FOR_FSM, WAITING_FOR_REMOTE_KVS, WAITING_FOR_STREAMING_REQ) from prefill lane selection, releasing lanes on KV allocation failure or Mamba zero-token split, keeping lane shares above the Mamba block quantum when step budget permits, and allowing preemption in the post-waiting interleave pass when a step scheduled zero tokens.

Quality:
Scheduler-only change; preserves exact aligned chunk boundaries when align_prefill_chunks=True and leaves the promoted single-lane --prefill-yield short path unchanged.

Tests:
- pytest tests/v1/core/test_prefill_lane_livelock.py tests/v1/core/test_prefill_qos_lanes.py tests/v1/core/test_aligned_prefill_lanes.py tests/v1/core/test_prefill_yield.py tests/v1/core/test_aligned_prefill_chunks.py tests/v1/core/test_prefill_compute_share_scheduler.py (116 passed).

Upstream status: local scheduler enhancement for parallel prefill lanes.
